# Indexing switch. Exactly "true" makes the site indexable; anything else (or
# unset) keeps it noindex. While src/content/unconfirmed.ts lists any item,
# "true" fails the build (the launch gate).
SITE_INDEXABLE=false

# The donation record. All three are server-side, never prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# The record scripts (pnpm record:*) read SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY
# in scripts/record/db.ts; the site's /admin reads all three in
# src/lib/admin/env.ts. With any missing, /admin answers 503 and the public
# pages are unaffected. On Vercel, set all three for /admin to open.
# SUPABASE_URL: Supabase dashboard, project operation-kokua, Settings > API (the project URL).
SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY: same page, API keys, the publishable key. Public by
# design (it is what a browser would hold); the site uses it server-side for Auth.
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_HnNBD7Mep0NHqzgqNZDI1w_2FbNHC4f
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY: same page, API keys, a secret key (sb_secret_...); never commit or print it.
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
